@*
    The headings of the figures of some calls, in the order that UsageCells writes them in
    (FR-RPT-3). A table of usage has them after the headings of what each row is of. Its texts
    are in UsagePages.
*@

<th scope="col">@UsagePages.CallsHeading</th>
<th scope="col">@UsagePages.NotCountedHeading</th>
<th scope="col">@UsagePages.TokensInHeading</th>
<th scope="col">@UsagePages.TokensOutHeading</th>
<th scope="col">@UsagePages.LiveSearchesHeading</th>
<th scope="col">@UsagePages.CostHeading</th>
